From c312f48d1e5bbd65c29f817f8c5155e0e7619c3b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CubeSat OBC Dev <dev@cubesat-obc.local>
Date: Fri, 27 Feb 2026 04:12:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: Linux/POSIX compatibility patches

- Add csp_hooks.c to POSIX arch with weak default implementations of
  csp_memfree_hook, csp_ps_hook, csp_reboot_hook and csp_shutdown_hook
  (previously only freertos/zephyr arches provided these, causing linker
  errors when building for Linux host)
- Update posix CMakeLists.txt to compile csp_hooks.c
- Patch csp_macro.h, csp_semaphore.c, csp_system.c, pthread_queue.c,
  usart_linux.c and eth_linux.c for Linux build compatibility
- Update driver and top-level CMakeLists.txt for POSIX/Linux build
